# lane/332: TS test-compile output and npm workspace build artifacts. Some
# per-app dirs also carry their own .gitignore with these same entries; this
# root one is the safety net (e.g. apps/ops-console had none and was leaking
# .test-dist/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo into git status before this lane).
